# Instanced UI rectangles blended (premultiplied) over a checkerboard. Instances, in order:
#  0 solid, zero radius          1 solid, mixed radii, translucent
#  2 linear gradient + border    3 radial gradient, radii larger than the box, border
#  4 border wider than radius    5 sub-pixel border
#  6 mixed radii, border, linear 7 transparent fill, outline only
#  8 translucent radial overlapping 0 and 1
# Per instance: rect, radii, colour0, colour1, border colour, gradient, border width, mode, 2 pad.
case ui_rect
shader 2d/ui_rect.hlsl
graphics vs=VSMain ps=PSMain
target 192 128 background=checker(8)
blend premul
tolerance 2
draw vertices=6 instances=9
uniform 0 0 : 192.0 128.0 0.0 0.0
